{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_8141ac0b14231c34891f04b36e5d88977d6b87daaf4c3a01491b032603aa6c72"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"cortex-sdk exposes createGateway() returning a Vercel AI SDK LanguageModel with listModels() discovery, supporting eight gateway providers including ConcentrateAI, OpenRouter, Gemini, MiniMax, NVIDIA NIM, and a server-proxied Supercode Cloud."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ced59a7192c83745f8472f380955637039c2e38d8ff74f098112075da7924777"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"cortex-sdk provides tool modules: createAgentHandler() (MergeDev MCP tool packs), createWebSearch() (Exa, Firecrawl, Context.dev), createComposio() (local SDK or server-proxied modes), createMcpManager() (GitHub/Linear/Slack/custom), and voice STT/TTS, all returning AI SDK Tool records."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d047a4e819a9404006cb9dcd01b8ab54e6ed2c63f46b08f437e0b5c53b6e97a8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A SupercodeAgent class combines gateway, agent-handler, composio, web search, MCP servers, and voice configuration in a single constructor object."}],"claim_ids":["clm_8141ac0b14231c34891f04b36e5d88977d6b87daaf4c3a01491b032603aa6c72","clm_ced59a7192c83745f8472f380955637039c2e38d8ff74f098112075da7924777","clm_d047a4e819a9404006cb9dcd01b8ab54e6ed2c63f46b08f437e0b5c53b6e97a8"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:24:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_179e36f3a967438396af3372ab33882e","id":"pg_c561de93e1865979bef5b5a7e7937ee1","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/yashdev9274-supercli-cortex-sdk-md-fbc5af280127-b5a7e7937ee1.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_54765066e7db500a9bc7357a310fcf15"],"title":"yashdev9274/supercli/cortex-sdk.md @ fbc5af280127","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:24:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_179e36f3a967438396af3372ab33882e"}
